{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》總決賽於今（23日）於啟德體藝館隆重舉行。TVB翡翠台同時全程直播，七強選手包括尹景順、許美琪、蔡宓婕、尤淑情、許雲妮、吳亦偉以及鄭家聲。決賽由車婉婉鄭衍峰擔任主持，重量級歌手李克勤與巫啟賢擔任星級評審，聯同五大專業評審肥媽、周國豐、張佳添、海兒及谷婭溦，見證王者誕生。決賽賽制共分兩回合，首回合由終極7強各自演繹快、慢歌各一首，分數將與「觀眾最愛好聲音」的票數合計，累積總分最高的三位選手將晉級第二回合，以「必殺歌」決勝負。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 19.01.26 (2).jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026x8wmoSPipT1787483135.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 19.01.26 (2).jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 18.51.41.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026LYyViDlXQn1787483136.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"batch_WhatsApp Image 2026-08-23 at 18.51.41.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T11:18:11.939224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}